  m_Name: CorruptedPower
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Description: 'An ancient power is flowing in you, increasing your damage by [BonusDamagePerc],
    but leaves you in a weakened state, increasing the damage taken by [ResistancePerc]
    and reducing your healings by [BonusHealPerc] per stack on you.

    You also
    take [DotDamage] damage every [Tick] seconds, and 20% of your current stacks
    as [Cursed] stacks'
